{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37790","headline":"右省张补阙茂枢同在谏垣连居光德新春赋咏聊以寄怀 · 郑谷","name":"右省张补阙茂枢同在谏垣连居光德新春赋咏聊以寄怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"小梅零落雪欺残，浩荡穷愁岂易宽。\n唯有郎吟偿晚景，且无浓醉厌春寒。\n高斋每喜追攀近，丽句先忧属和难。\n十五年前谙苦节，知心不独爲同官。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37790.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37790","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}